    "text": "By Skylar Fisher ,\n1 days ago\nSIOUX FALLS, S.D. (KELO) — Here’s a look at today’s top stories for KELOLAND On the Go.\nTwo Sioux Falls residents were taken to jail after fighting with an employee at a business Sunday morning. The initial report stated that the male and female suspects ordered food at this business. While the food was being prepared, the suspects went behind the counter and were told to leave the area.\n18 & 19-year-olds accused of assaulting employee Sunday Two people are looking to become the next mayor of Sioux Falls: Christine Erickson and Jamie Smith. From campaign finances to what they see as the biggest issues facing Sioux Falls, we give you one final look at each candidate.\nSF mayoral race: Final messages from Smith and Erickson",
